     declared last, so they merge after the Akan culture, troops and settlements
     they depend on, exactly as they did when Maroons loaded below Akans.
     Campaign-only: clans, kingdoms and heroes have no meaning in CustomGame or
     EditorGame. If the old Maroons module is still installed, DISABLE it -
